<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Menu Chức Năng - Staff</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gridstack@8.2.1/dist/gridstack.min.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        /* Hiệu ứng chuyển động cho các khối màu nền (Blobs) */
        @keyframes blob {
            0% { transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1); }
            33% { transform: translate(30px, -50px) scale(1.1); }
            66% { transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.9); }
            100% { transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1); }
        }
        .animate-blob { animation: blob 7s infinite; }
        .animation-delay-2000 { animation-delay: 2s; }
        .animation-delay-4000 { animation-delay: 4s; }
        
        body { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        .grid-stack-item-content { overflow: visible !important; }
        .grid-stack-placeholder > .placeholder-content {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
            border: 2px dashed #6366f1;
            border-radius: 2rem; 
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-5px); } 
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } 
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50/50 font-sans text-slate-800 pb-20 relative min-h-screen">

    <div class="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden -z-10 pointer-events-none">
        <div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-purple-300/40 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[80px] opacity-70 animate-blob"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-[20%] right-[-10%] w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-cyan-300/40 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[80px] opacity-70 animate-blob animation-delay-2000"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-[-20%] left-[20%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-pink-300/40 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[80px] opacity-70 animate-blob animation-delay-4000"></div> 
    </div>

    <div class="w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8 space-y-8 pt-8 relative z-10">
        
        <div class="bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/60 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-6"> 
            <div class="w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500 to-cyan-400 rounded-[1.5rem] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200/50 rotate-3 shrink-0">
                <i class="bi bi-stars"></i> 
            </div>
            <div class="text-center md:text-left flex-1">
                <p class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-black text-indigo-600/70 uppercase tracking-widest m-0 mb-1">Không gian làm việc</p> 
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-800 tracking-tight m-0 mb-2">Xin chào, <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-cyan-500"><%= typeof full_name !== 'undefined' ? full_name : 'Bạn' %></span>! 👋</h3> 
                <p class="text-slate-500 m-0 text-sm md:text-base font-bold">Chúc bạn một ngày làm việc tràn đầy năng lượng ✨</p> 
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-end gap-3 mb-4">
            <a id="btn-logout" href="/auth/logout" onclick="return confirm('Đăng xuất khỏi hệ thống?');"
               class="px-5 py-2.5 md:px-6 md:py-3 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/80 text-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-50 rounded-xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm active:scale-95">
                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right text-lg"></i> Thoát
            </a> 

            <button id="btn-edit-mode" onclick="enableEditMode()" class="px-5 py-2.5 md:px-6 md:py-3 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/80 text-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm active:scale-95">
                <i class="bi bi-pencil-square text-lg"></i> Sửa Giao Diện
            </button> 
            
            <div id="edit-controls" class="hidden flex items-center gap-2 animate-[fadeIn_0.3s_ease-out]">
                <button onclick="resetDashboardLayout()" class="px-4 py-3 bg-rose-100/80 backdrop-blur-md text-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-200 rounded-xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2" title="Khôi phục mặc định">
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"></i> Reset
                </button> 

                <button onclick="cancelEdit()" class="px-5 py-3 bg-slate-100/80 backdrop-blur-md text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 rounded-xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i> Hủy
                </button> 
                <button onclick="saveDashboardLayout()" class="px-5 py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white rounded-xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 flex items-center gap-2 transition-all active:scale-95">
                    <i class="bi bi-check-lg"></i> Lưu & Đóng
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="edit-banner" class="hidden mb-6 p-4 bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 backdrop-blur-md text-amber-700 rounded-2xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-center animate-pulse">
            <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i> Chế độ chỉnh sửa: Kéo thả các khối hoặc kéo viền để đổi kích thước
        </div> 

        <div class="grid-stack mb-12"> 

            <div class="grid-stack-item" gs-id="widget_leaderboard" gs-x="0" gs-y="0" gs-w="4" gs-h="2" gs-min-w="3" gs-min-h="1">
                <div class="grid-stack-item-content">
                    <a href="/staff/leaderboard" class="w-full h-full relative bg-gradient-to-br from-white/60 to-white/30 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/80 p-4 md:p-8 rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] group overflow-hidden flex flex-row items-center justify-start gap-4 md:gap-6 transition-all text-left">
                        <div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-32 h-32 bg-amber-400/20 rounded-full blur-xl"></div> 
                        <div class="relative z-10 w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-400 to-yellow-300 text-white rounded-[1.2rem] md:rounded-[1.5rem] flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-amber-200/50 border border-white/50 rotate-3 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-transform shrink-0"> 
                            <i class="bi bi-trophy-fill text-3xl md:text-4xl"></i> 
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative z-10 flex-1 min-w-0">
                            <span class="text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-tight leading-tight truncate block w-full">Bảng Thi Đua 🏆</span> 
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs md:text-sm font-bold truncate m-0 mt-1">Xem thành tích & Xếp hạng.</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid-stack-item" gs-id="widget_customers" gs-x="4" gs-y="0" gs-w="2" gs-h="1" gs-min-w="2" gs-min-h="1"> 
                <div class="grid-stack-item-content">
                    <a href="/staff/customers" class="w-full h-full relative bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/60 p-3 md:p-5 rounded-[1.2rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] group overflow-hidden flex flex-row items-center justify-start gap-3 md:gap-4 text-left hover:shadow-[0_15px_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.15)] transition-shadow"> 
                        <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 md:w-14 md:h-14 bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-500 to-cyan-400 text-white rounded-xl md:rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner border border-white/50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shrink-0">
                            <i class="bi bi-people-fill text-xl md:text-2xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative z-10 flex-1 min-w-0">
                            <span class="text-sm md:text-base font-black text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-tight leading-tight truncate block w-full">Khách hàng</span>
                        </div>
